Package: golfops
Title: Golf Participation and Revenue Summaries
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Locke", email = "justinrlocke@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Summarizes municipal golf participation, daylight-estimated
    utilization, and revenue for City of Mesa Dobson Ranch. Operating charts
    use one documented daily sample. Revenue ratios are historical
    relationships, and tournament results are break-even baselines. Forecasts
    of observed rounds are not latent demand and not price elasticities. A
    labeled synthetic ticket series remains a secondary example.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://data.mesaaz.gov/Parks-Recreation-and-Community-Facilities/Dobson-Ranch-Golf-Rounds/24g5-hb8k
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
